    "The usual window has passed. There is no current estimate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The usual window has passed. There is no current estimate."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der bisher übliche Zeitraum ist vorbei. Es gibt keine aktuelle Schätzung."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A janela habitual já passou. Não há estimativa atual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiles show one time each. What's next opens from Home with the full windows and how each was worked out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiles show one time each. What's next opens from Home with the full windows and how each was worked out."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kacheln zeigen je eine Uhrzeit. „Was kommt als Nächstes?“ öffnet sich auf der Übersicht mit den vollständigen Zeiträumen und ihrer Herleitung."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os blocos mostram um horário cada. O que vem a seguir abre no Início com as janelas completas e como cada uma foi calculada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the last 14 days and up to ten similar intervals near the same time of day. At least four intervals across three days are required. Sparse, irregular, incomplete, or stale data produces no estimate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the last 14 days and up to ten similar intervals near the same time of day. At least four intervals across three days are required. Sparse, irregular, incomplete, or stale data produces no estimate."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwendet die letzten 14 Tage und bis zu zehn ähnliche Abstände zu einer vergleichbaren Tageszeit. Erforderlich sind mindestens vier Abstände an drei Tagen. Bei zu wenigen, unregelmäßigen, unvollständigen oder veralteten Daten wird keine Schätzung angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa os últimos 14 dias e até dez intervalos semelhantes perto do mesmo horário. São necessários pelo menos quatro intervalos em três dias. Dados escassos, irregulares, incompletos ou desatualizados não geram estimativa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
